  "id": "71dd213b-3d60-48f8-a94c-a4a6d2ed2475",
  "attendingFormat": "InPerson",
  "category": "Summit",
  "code": "AIFIN26",
  "description": "<div class=\"ag87-crtemvc-hsbk\"><div class=\"css-vsf5of\"><p class=\"carina-rte-public-DraftStyleDefault-block\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Join Bloomberg and our CEO, Vlad Kliatchko, at our flagship AI in Finance Summit, an exclusive gathering of senior financial leaders, policymakers, and technology luminaries.</span></p><p class=\"carina-rte-public-DraftStyleDefault-block\"><span>As AI adoption accelerates across financial markets, the conversation is shifting from experimentation to execution, and to the decisions that will determine where AI creates lasting value and competitive differentiation.</span></p><p class=\"carina-rte-public-DraftStyleDefault-block\"><span>Through executive discussions and panel sessions, the program will explore:</span></p><ul><li><span>Where AI is delivering measurable value and creating investment edge</span></li><li><span>How it is reshaping research, investment workflows, and the role of financial professionals</span></li><li><span>How firms should approach governance and accountability as AI becomes more agentic</span></li></ul><p class=\"carina-rte-public-DraftStyleDefault-block\"><span>Attendees will also have the opportunity to experience Bloomberg\u2019s latest AI developments and see how they are being applied to help financial professionals work more efficiently and make more informed decisions.</span></p></div></div>",
